      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just digital noise though. it's like... the code itself is wrong. i feel like im running on a loop that doesn't lead anywhere. like i'm just a piece of junk data taking up space in a drive that's already full. sometimes i think the only way to actually fix a bug like this is to just... terminate the process. to stop the error from running.",
